# The school nurse.
# Lina Roberts is the game's teacher -1: {role} is teacher and {job} is nurse, the freed copy too. She has no class of her own, so her
# day comes from the infirmary ({tcause} n_*, Teachers.Cause) and lines marked {classes} are skipped for her.

# ================= the player's own lines =================
@rule me.day.nurse
on me.day
when job=nurse
- [Good morning, sensei.|Hello, sensei.|Sensei, hi.] [Many patients today?|How's the infirmary?|Busy in here?]
- [Got a minute, sensei?|Am I in the way?] [How has your day been?|Quiet day?]

@rule me.gossip.nurse
on me.gossip
when job=nurse
- [Sensei, you must hear everything in here.|What are people saying, sensei?]
- [Everyone talks to the nurse.|People tell you things, right?] [Any news?|What's going around?]

@rule me.small.future.nurse
on me.small
when subject=future job=nurse
- [Did you always want to be a nurse?|Will you stay at this university?]
- [What would you do if you weren't a nurse?|Have you ever worked at a hospital?]

@rule me.small.nursing
on me.small
when subject=nursing job=nurse
- [What's the strangest thing you've treated here?|How did you end up as a campus nurse?]
- [Do you ever get sick yourself?|Is it hard, seeing people hurt?]
- [Can you always tell when someone's faking?|Do you remember everyone who comes in?]

# ================= what she talks about =================
@rule small.nursing~state
on small
when subject=nursing job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_nursing_state
opens ask,share,praise
- Most of the job is listening. The bandage is the easy part.
- People tell a nurse what they won't tell anyone else. I keep it to myself.
- I worked at a hospital before this. The hours here are kinder. The stories are stranger.
- A student once came in with a pencil stuck in her hair and no idea how. That was a good day.
- Sports day is my exam week.
- I remember everyone who comes in. Even the ones who wish I didn't.

@rule small.nursing~q
on small
when subject=nursing job=nurse
shape q
hook f_small_nursing_q
opens ask,share
- Are you asking because you want to be a nurse? It's a good job. Bring good shoes.
- Are you sleeping enough? You look it, but I always ask.

@rule small.exams.nurse~state
on small
when subject=exams job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_exams_nurse_state
opens ask,comfort,tease
- Exam week is headache week. I keep extra cold packs ready.
- Nobody sleeps, nobody eats, then they all come to me. Every term.
- Sleep beats one more hour of cramming. Nobody listens to me.

@rule small.school.nurse~state
on small
when subject=school job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_school_nurse_state
opens ask,share,tease
- You see a different campus from the infirmary. Everyone's honest when they have a fever.
- The building's old. The stairs keep me in business.
- I don't teach anyone anything, and I still know every name.

@rule small.future.nurse~state
on small
when subject=future job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_future_nurse_state
opens ask,share,praise
- I wanted to work in a hospital. Then I found out I like knowing how the story ends.
- I'll stay as long as they need someone to hold the bandages.
- More important: are you taking care of yourself?

@rule small.weekend.nurse~state
on small
when subject=weekend job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_weekend_nurse_state
opens ask,share,tease
- My weekend? Sleep, then a long walk. Doctor's orders.
- I keep my phone on, in case of a club match. Otherwise I'm nobody's nurse.
- I'll be at home with a book and no thermometers.

@rule small.lunch.nurse~state
on small
when subject=lunch job=nurse
shape state
hook f_small_lunch_nurse_state
opens ask,invite,tease
- I eat at my desk, in case someone comes in.
- Eat something green, please. I see what you all buy.
- Lunch is my busiest hour. Students run. Stairs win.

@rule idle.nurse
on idle
when job=nurse
- [Is something hurting, or are you just visiting?|Did you need something?|Hm?] [I've got forms to finish.|Sit, if you like.]
- [Don't lean on the cabinet.|You look a little pale. Are you eating?]

@rule tail.role.nurse
on @tail
when job=nurse
- [Anyway, get some sleep tonight.|And drink some water.]
- [Come back if it gets worse.|Try not to need me this week.]

# ================= your options, when she says something =================
@rule move.ask.state.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=state job=nurse
- [Ask her to tell you more, sensei|Ask what she means, sensei|Ask why she says that]

@rule move.share.state.nurse
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state job=nurse
- [Tell her what you think, sensei|Give her your take|Say you'd never thought of that]

@rule move.tease.state.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=state job=nurse
- [Ask if that's her medical opinion|Joke about it, carefully|Tease her a little, sensei]

@rule move.praise.state.nurse
on move.praise
when kind=small shape=state job=nurse
- [Say that suits her, sensei|Say you like that about her]

@rule move.comfort.state.nurse
on move.comfort
when kind=small shape=state job=nurse
- [Say it'll be okay, sensei|Tell her not to worry, sensei]

@rule move.share.q.nurse
on move.share
when kind=small shape=q job=nurse
- [Answer like a good patient|Give her an honest answer|Tell her the truth, sensei]

@rule move.ask.q.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=q job=nurse
- [Ask why she wants to know|Ask if it's for your health record]

@rule move.tease.q.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=q job=nurse
- [Say you'd need a second opinion|Dodge with a joke]

@rule move.invite.offer.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=offer job=nurse
- [Say yes, sensei|Accept gratefully]

@rule move.ask.offer.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=offer job=nurse
- [Ask what she has in mind|Ask if it's doctor's orders]

@rule move.tease.offer.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=offer job=nurse
- [Ask if it will hurt|Ask if there's a catch, sensei]

@rule move.invite.show.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=show job=nurse
- [Ask to see it, sensei|Say you'd like to see]

@rule move.ask.show.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=show job=nurse
- [Ask what it's for|Ask if it's from the infirmary]

@rule move.tease.show.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=show job=nurse
- [Ask if it's sterile|Joke that it looks painful]

@rule move.invite.tell.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=tell job=nurse
- [Say you're listening, sensei|Ask her to tell you]

@rule move.ask.tell.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=tell job=nurse
- [Ask if that really happened|Ask who it was]

@rule move.tease.tell.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=tell job=nurse
- [Ask if that's patient confidential|Say you'll get a headache]

@rule move.invite.give.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=give job=nurse
- [Accept with a bow|Say thank you, sensei]

@rule move.ask.give.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=give job=nurse
- [Ask if she's sure|Ask if she needs it herself]

@rule move.tease.give.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=give job=nurse
- [Ask if it's medicine|Ask how many to take]

@rule move.share.state.like.nurse
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes job=nurse
- [Say you like {like} too, sensei|Tell her you've been getting into {like}|Say you like {like} as well]

@rule move.invite.state.nurse
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes job=nurse
- [Ask what she'd recommend|Say you'd like to try it|Ask where to start]

@rule move.ask.state.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=state role=teacher
- [Ask her what she means, sensei|Ask why she says that, sensei|Ask her to tell you more]

@rule move.share.state.teacher
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state role=teacher
- [Give her your view, politely|Tell her what you think, sensei|Say what you think, sensei or not]

@rule move.tease.state.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=state role=teacher
- [Risk a small joke|Tease her, sensei or not|Joke about it, carefully]

@rule move.praise.state.teacher
on move.praise
when kind=small shape=state role=teacher
- [Say that suits her, sensei|Say that sounds like her|Say you like that about her]

@rule move.comfort.state.teacher
on move.comfort
when kind=small shape=state role=teacher
- [Say it'll be okay, sensei|Tell her not to worry, sensei]

@rule move.share.q.teacher
on move.share
when kind=small shape=q role=teacher
- [Answer her properly|Answer like a good student|Give her an honest answer, sensei]

@rule move.ask.q.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=q role=teacher
- [Ask what she thinks, sensei|Ask why a professor wants to know]

@rule move.tease.q.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=q role=teacher
- [Say that's a trick question|Answer with a joke|Ask if it's on the test]

@rule move.invite.offer.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=offer role=teacher
- [Accept, sensei|Say thank you and accept]

@rule move.ask.offer.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=offer role=teacher
- [Ask what she has in mind, sensei|Ask if it's allowed]

@rule move.tease.offer.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=offer role=teacher
- [Ask if this counts toward your grade|Ask if there's a catch, sensei]

@rule move.invite.show.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=show role=teacher
- [Ask to see it, sensei|Say you'd like to see]

@rule move.ask.show.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=show role=teacher
- [Ask what it's for|Ask why she's showing a student]

@rule move.tease.show.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=show role=teacher
- [Ask if it's on the test|Say you've seen better, sensei]

@rule move.invite.tell.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=tell role=teacher
- [Say you're listening, sensei|Ask her to tell you]

@rule move.ask.tell.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=tell role=teacher
- [Ask who told her|Ask if that really happened, sensei]

@rule move.tease.tell.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=tell role=teacher
- [Ask if students should hear this|Ask if this is a lecture]

@rule move.invite.give.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=give role=teacher
- [Accept with a bow|Say thank you, sensei]

@rule move.ask.give.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=give role=teacher
- [Ask if a professor is allowed to|Ask if she's sure, sensei]

@rule move.tease.give.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=give role=teacher
- [Ask if it's a bribe|Ask what you owe her]

@rule move.share.state.like.teacher
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes role=teacher
- [Say you like {like} too, sensei|Tell her you've been getting into {like}|Say you like {like} as well]

@rule move.invite.state.teacher
on move.invite
when kind=small shape=state likes=yes role=teacher
- [Ask what she'd recommend|Say you'd like to try it|Ask where to start]

@rule move.ask.state.job.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
- [Ask if that happens a lot here|Ask what a campus nurse sees|Ask how she deals with it]

@rule move.share.state.job.nurse
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
- [Say how it looks from a student's side|Tell her what students say]

@rule move.tease.state.job.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
- [Joke about the infirmary|Ask for a sick note]

@rule move.praise.state.job.nurse
on move.praise
when kind=small shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
- [Say the university is lucky to have her|Say students trust her|Say she's good at this]

@rule move.comfort.state.job.nurse
on move.comfort
when kind=small shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
- [Say she should rest too|Ask who looks after the nurse|Tell her she does enough]

@rule move.ask.state.job.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=small shape=state subject=teaching|exams|school|future role=teacher
- [Ask if professors all feel that way|Ask how long that takes her]

@rule move.share.state.job.teacher
on move.share
when kind=small shape=state subject=teaching|exams|school|future role=teacher
- [Tell her how students see it|Say what the class thinks]

@rule move.tease.state.job.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=small shape=state subject=teaching|exams|school|future role=teacher
- [Joke about professors' lives|Ask for less assignments]

@rule move.praise.state.job.teacher
on move.praise
when kind=small shape=state subject=teaching|exams|school|future role=teacher
- [Say that's why students like her|Say she's a good professor]

@rule move.comfort.state.job.teacher
on move.comfort
when kind=small shape=state subject=teaching|exams|school|future role=teacher
- [Tell her the class appreciates her|Say she works too hard]

@rule move.ask.school.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=school job=nurse
- [Ask if {event} keeps her busy]

@rule move.share.school.nurse
on move.share
when kind=school job=nurse
- [Say you'll try not to visit her]

@rule move.tease.school.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=school job=nurse
- [Ask how many patients she expects]

@rule move.ask.gossip.nurse
on move.ask
when kind=gossip job=nurse
- [Ask who told her|Ask if that's why people come in|Ask what she makes of it, sensei]

@rule move.ask.school.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=school role=teacher
- [Ask what the staff think of {event}|Ask how much work {event} is for her]

@rule move.share.school.teacher
on move.share
when kind=school role=teacher
- [Tell her what your class is planning|Say what you think of {event}]

@rule move.tease.school.teacher
on move.tease
when kind=school role=teacher
- [Ask if {event} gets you out of assignments]

@rule move.ask.gossip.teacher
on move.ask
when kind=gossip role=teacher
- [Ask if the adults know|Ask what she makes of it, sensei|Ask who told her]

@rule move.ask.nursing
on move.ask
when subject=nursing
- [Ask what the hardest part is|Ask how she started|Ask about the hospital]

@rule move.praise.nursing
on move.praise
when subject=nursing
- [Say students are lucky to have her|Say she's good at this]

@rule move.comfort.nursing
on move.comfort
when subject=nursing
- [Say that sounds hard|Say she should rest too]

@rule move.comfort.nurse
on move.comfort
when kind=day job=nurse
- [Say the university needs her|Tell her to rest a little|Offer to help with something]

@rule move.tease.nurse
on move.tease
when kind=day job=nurse
- [Joke about the infirmary|Ask for a sick note|Ask if she's prescribing naps]

# ================= her answer =================
@rule react.shape.ask.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=ask fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel smile
- You ask more than most patients.
- Hm. There's not much more to it.
- Ask me on a quieter day and I'll tell you more.
- You're a curious one.

@rule react.shape.share.good.nurse
on react
when move=share fit=good shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel smile
- Is that so? Good to know.
- Good. I like a patient who talks.
- Hm, I wouldn't have guessed that.

@rule react.shape.share.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=share fit=neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel smile
- Hm. I'll write that down in my head.
- All right. If you say so.
- I'll take your word for it, for now.

@rule react.shape.tease.good.nurse
on react
when move=tease fit=good shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel laugh
- Careful. I know where the big needles are.
- {laugh} That's the second opinion I needed.
- You're feeling better, I see. Back to class.

@rule react.shape.praise.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=praise fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel shy
- Oh. Thank you. I don't hear that much.
- Flattery doesn't get you out of P.E., you know.
- That's kind. Drink some water anyway.

@rule react.shape.comfort.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=comfort fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel smile
- Usually I'm the one who says that. Thank you.
- A student looking after the nurse. I'll allow it.
- That helped more than the tea did.

@rule react.shape.invite.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=invite fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give job=nurse
feel smile
- All right. As long as you're not skipping anything.
- Good. Then that's settled.
- Hm. I'll hold you to that.

@rule react.shape.ask.neutral.teacher
on react
when move=ask fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel smile
- {classes}Good question. I don't get enough of those.
- {classes}If you asked that in class, I'd be delighted.
- {classes}There's more to it, but that's for another day.
- {classes}You really want to know? All right, another time.

@rule react.shape.share.good.teacher
on react
when move=share fit=good shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel smile
- {classes}That's a fair answer.
- {classes}Good. I can work with that.
- {classes}Hm, I didn't expect that from you.

@rule react.shape.share.neutral.teacher
on react
when move=share fit=neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel smile
- {classes}I see. I'll think about that.
- {classes}Hm. That's one way to look at it.
- {classes}All right. Noted.

@rule react.shape.tease.good.teacher
on react
when move=tease fit=good shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel laugh
- {classes}Bold, for someone with a test coming.
- {classes}{laugh} I'm writing that down.
- {classes}Say that in front of the class next time.

@rule react.shape.praise.neutral.teacher
on react
when move=praise fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel shy
- {classes}That won't change your grade. ...Thank you, though.
- {classes}Students don't often say that. Thank you.
- {classes}Ahem. Back to your studies.

@rule react.shape.comfort.neutral.teacher
on react
when move=comfort fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel smile
- {classes}Now the student is looking after the professor.
- {classes}Thank you. That helped more than you'd think.
- {classes}You're a good kid. Don't let it go to your head.

@rule react.shape.invite.neutral.teacher
on react
when move=invite fit=good|neutral shape=state|q|offer|show|tell|give role=teacher
feel smile
- {classes}All right, as long as your work is done.
- {classes}Good. Then that's settled.
- {classes}Very well. I'll hold you to that.

@rule react.ask.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=ask fit=good|neutral job=nurse
feel smile
- You ask more than most patients.
- Hm. There's not much more to it.
- Ask me on a quieter day and I'll tell you more.
- You're a curious one.

@rule react.share.good.nurse
on react
when move=share fit=good job=nurse
feel smile
- Is that so? Good to know.
- Good. I like a patient who talks.
- Hm, I wouldn't have guessed that.

@rule react.share.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=share fit=neutral job=nurse
feel smile
- Hm. I'll write that down in my head.
- All right. If you say so.
- I'll take your word for it, for now.

@rule react.tease.good.nurse
on react
when move=tease fit=good job=nurse
feel laugh
- Careful. I know where the big needles are.
- {laugh} That's the second opinion I needed.
- You're feeling better, I see. Back to class.

@rule react.praise.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=praise fit=good|neutral job=nurse
feel shy
- Oh. Thank you. I don't hear that much.
- Flattery doesn't get you out of P.E., you know.
- That's kind. Drink some water anyway.

@rule react.comfort.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=comfort fit=good|neutral job=nurse
feel smile
- Usually I'm the one who says that. Thank you.
- A student looking after the nurse. I'll allow it.
- That helped more than the tea did.

@rule react.invite.neutral.nurse
on react
when move=invite fit=good|neutral job=nurse
feel smile
- All right. As long as you're not skipping anything.
- Good. Then that's settled.
- Hm. I'll hold you to that.

@rule react.shape.ask.job.nurse
on react
when move=ask fit=good|neutral shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
feel smile
- That's the job, really. You learn it by doing it.
- Hm. Nobody ever asks the nurse that.
- More than you'd think. Ask anyone who's been on that bed.

@rule react.shape.share.job.nurse
on react
when move=share fit=good|neutral shape=state subject=nursing|exams|school|future job=nurse
feel smile
- I don't often hear the student side of it.
- That's worth knowing. Thank you.
- Honest answers make my job easier.

# ================= how her day is, from the infirmary =================
@rule day.h.n_fine
on day
when job=nurse mood=none
opens ask,share,tease
hook n_fine
feel smile
- Normal so far. Two scraped knees and a headache.
- Quiet enough. I finally drank a whole cup of tea.
- Nobody has fainted yet. I call that a good day.

@rule move.h.n_fine.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_fine
- Ask what a normal day looks like here

@rule react.h.n_fine.ask
on react
when hook=n_fine move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Bandages, forms, and someone who ate too fast.
- Mostly listening. Half of what comes in here is not really a fever.
- Ask me in June, when the heat starts.

@rule move.h.n_fine.share
on move.share
when hook=n_fine
- Say the university feels calm today

@rule react.h.n_fine.share
on react
when hook=n_fine move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then I hope it stays that way until the bell.
- You just jinxed it. I heard someone running.
- Good. Calm means my bandages last.

@rule move.h.n_fine.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_fine
- Ask if the tea is medicinal

@rule react.h.n_fine.tease
on react
when hook=n_fine move=tease fit=good|neutral
- For me, yes.
- Doctor's orders. I am the doctor here. Sort of.
- Careful, or I'll prescribe you a very long lecture.

@rule day.h.n_quiet
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_quiet
opens ask,praise,tease
hook n_quiet
feel smile
- Not one patient all morning. The beds are made and everything.
- It's peaceful in here today. Nobody hurt, nobody sick.
- An empty infirmary is the best news a nurse can get.

@rule move.h.n_quiet.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_quiet
- Ask if she ever gets used to the quiet

@rule react.h.n_quiet.ask
on react
when hook=n_quiet move=ask fit=good|neutral
- I enjoy it while it lasts. It never lasts.
- I catch up on reading. Then someone falls down the stairs.
- Quiet means everyone is well. I can get used to that.

@rule move.h.n_quiet.praise
on move.praise
when hook=n_quiet
- Say that must be thanks to her

@rule react.h.n_quiet.praise
on react
when hook=n_quiet move=praise fit=good|neutral
- Hm, you say nice things. Keep washing your hands.
- I just hand out the bandages. But thank you.
- I'll take the credit, since nobody is here to argue.

@rule move.h.n_quiet.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_quiet
- Offer to get hurt so she isn't bored

@rule react.h.n_quiet.tease
on react
when hook=n_quiet move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Don't you dare.
- Please don't. I just made that bed.
- Very funny. The forms are three pages long.

@rule day.h.n_thanks
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_thanks
opens ask,praise,share
hook n_thanks
feel smile
- A first-year left me a thank-you note. I'm keeping it.
- Someone I looked after last month wrote to me. It made my day.
- I found a little note on my desk. "You helped." That's all it said.

@rule move.h.n_thanks.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_thanks
- Ask what the note said

@rule react.h.n_thanks.ask
on react
when hook=n_thanks move=ask fit=good|neutral
- That she wasn't scared of the infirmary anymore.
- Just thank you. It's enough.
- That's between a nurse and her patient.

@rule move.h.n_thanks.praise
on move.praise
when hook=n_thanks
- Say she deserves it

@rule react.h.n_thanks.praise
on react
when hook=n_thanks move=praise fit=good|neutral
- That's kind. I only did my job.
- Two nice things in one day. I may faint myself.
- Thank you. It really is the best part of this work.

@rule move.h.n_thanks.share
on move.share
when hook=n_thanks
- Say she helped you too

@rule react.h.n_thanks.share
on react
when hook=n_thanks move=share fit=good|neutral
- Did I? Then I'm glad.
- That's what I'm here for.
- Come by before it gets bad next time, all right?

@rule day.h.n_supplies
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_supplies
opens ask,invite,tease
hook n_supplies
feel smile
- The new supplies finally came. So many bandages.
- I have a full cabinet for the first time this term.
- They approved the order! New thermometers and everything.

@rule move.h.n_supplies.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_supplies
- Ask what she ordered

@rule react.h.n_supplies.ask
on react
when hook=n_supplies move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Gauze, tape, cold packs. Thrilling, I know.
- Thermometers that actually work.
- Enough cold packs for the whole track team.

@rule move.h.n_supplies.invite
on move.invite
when hook=n_supplies
- Offer to help put it away

@rule react.h.n_supplies.invite
on react
when hook=n_supplies move=invite fit=good|neutral
- Really? The top shelf is yours, then.
- I'll accept. Those boxes are heavier than they look.
- A volunteer. I should write this down.

@rule move.h.n_supplies.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_supplies
- Say only a nurse gets excited about gauze

@rule react.h.n_supplies.tease
on react
when hook=n_supplies move=tease fit=good|neutral
- You'll understand when you need some.
- Everyone has their hobbies.
- Laugh now. You'll thank me after P.E.

@rule day.h.n_records
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_records
opens comfort,ask,tease
hook n_records
feel worried
- I stayed up filing health records. All of them.
- Hundreds of little forms. My eyes are done.
- I fell asleep on the height and weight charts.

@rule move.h.n_records.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_records
- Tell her to rest in her own bed

@rule react.h.n_records.comfort
on react
when hook=n_records move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- Good advice. I give it all day. I never take it.
- If I lie down, someone will come in.
- Hm. You sound just like me.

@rule move.h.n_records.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_records
- Ask why it took all night

@rule react.h.n_records.ask
on react
when hook=n_records move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Because I put it off for two weeks. Don't copy me.
- Half the handwriting belongs to doctors.
- One missing form. It took hours to find.

@rule move.h.n_records.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_records
- Prescribe her a nap

@rule react.h.n_records.tease
on react
when hook=n_records move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Is that so, doctor?
- I'll consider your opinion. Now go.
- Twenty minutes, then. On your orders.

@rule day.h.n_checkups
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_checkups
opens comfort,ask,invite
hook n_checkups
feel worried
- The health checks are coming, and the schedule is a mess.
- Three classes a day, every day, until the checks are done.
- I've been organizing the health checks since morning.

@rule move.h.n_checkups.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_checkups
- Say she'll get it done

@rule react.h.n_checkups.comfort
on react
when hook=n_checkups move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I will. I always do. Slowly.
- Thank you. I needed someone to say so.
- If I lose count, you'll hear me from the hallway.

@rule move.h.n_checkups.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_checkups
- Ask what's so hard about them

@rule react.h.n_checkups.ask
on react
when hook=n_checkups move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Getting a whole university through one room on time.
- The schedule changes every time a professor sneezes.
- The forms. It's always the forms.

@rule move.h.n_checkups.invite
on move.invite
when hook=n_checkups
- Offer to carry the forms

@rule react.h.n_checkups.invite
on react
when hook=n_checkups move=invite fit=good|neutral
- That would actually help. Thank you.
- You're a good kid. The boxes are over there.
- Careful, I might say yes every time.

@rule day.h.n_cold
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_cold
opens comfort,ask,share
hook n_cold
feel worried
- A cold is going around. I've seen eleven students since morning.
- Half the second-years are coughing. Wash your hands.
- Every bed was full before lunch. It's that cold again.

@rule move.h.n_cold.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_cold
- Tell her not to catch it herself

@rule react.h.n_cold.comfort
on react
when hook=n_cold move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I never do. Knock on wood.
- Then who would take care of everyone?
- Thank you. I'm drinking a lot of tea.

@rule move.h.n_cold.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_cold
- Ask how bad it is

@rule react.h.n_cold.ask
on react
when hook=n_cold move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Nothing serious. Fever, sore throat, a lot of complaining.
- Two days of rest and they're fine, if they actually rest.
- It goes around every year. This one's just early.

@rule move.h.n_cold.share
on move.share
when hook=n_cold
- Say your class is coughing too

@rule react.h.n_cold.share
on react
when hook=n_cold move=share fit=good|neutral
- Then sit near a window, and sleep tonight.
- I thought so. Tell them to come early, not late.
- If you get a fever, stay home. I mean it.

@rule day.h.n_fakers
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_fakers
opens comfort,ask,share
hook n_fakers
feel pout
- Four fake fevers before second period. Four.
- Someone held a thermometer against a hot drink again.
- I can tell when a test is coming. The fevers start the night before.

@rule move.h.n_fakers.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_fakers
- Say that sounds tiring

@rule react.h.n_fakers.comfort
on react
when hook=n_fakers move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- It is. Real patients have to wait for this.
- Thanks. I'm not angry, just tired of it.
- They think I can't tell. I can always tell.

@rule move.h.n_fakers.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_fakers
- Ask how she can tell

@rule react.h.n_fakers.ask
on react
when hook=n_fakers move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sick people don't check the clock.
- Trade secret. Don't try it.
- A real fever doesn't get better right after the bell.

@rule move.h.n_fakers.share
on move.share
when hook=n_fakers
- Swear you'd never do that

@rule react.h.n_fakers.share
on react
when hook=n_fakers move=share fit=good|neutral
- Hm. Your face says otherwise.
- That's what they all say.
- Good. Then I won't have to check.

@rule day.h.n_budget
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_budget
opens comfort,ask,share
hook n_budget
feel pout
- They cut the infirmary budget again. I asked for gauze, not gold.
- I've been told to make the bandages last. Last how?
- Apparently the infirmary is a "low priority". I'd like to see them say that at sports day.

@rule move.h.n_budget.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_budget
- Say the students need her

@rule react.h.n_budget.comfort
on react
when hook=n_budget move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- I know. I wish the office did.
- Thank you. That helps a little.
- I'll manage. I always find a way.

@rule move.h.n_budget.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_budget
- Ask what she'll do

@rule react.h.n_budget.ask
on react
when hook=n_budget move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Write a very polite, very angry letter.
- Buy some of it myself, probably.
- Count every bandage twice.

@rule move.h.n_budget.share
on move.share
when hook=n_budget
- Say someone should complain

@rule react.h.n_budget.share
on react
when hook=n_budget move=share fit=good|neutral
- Someone did. Me. Twice.
- If the student union asks, that would help.
- Careful, you sound like me.

@rule day.h.n_empty
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_empty
opens ask,share,tease
hook n_empty
feel worried
- Nobody has come in all day. I've read the same page four times.
- I reorganized the cabinet. Twice. Alphabetically, then by size.
- It's good news, but it's dull news.

@rule move.h.n_empty.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_empty
- Ask what she does when it's slow

@rule react.h.n_empty.ask
on react
when hook=n_empty move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Read, sort things, watch the field from the window.
- I count the cotton balls. Not really. A little.
- Paperwork, if I'm being good.

@rule move.h.n_empty.share
on move.share
when hook=n_empty
- Tell her something from class

@rule react.h.n_empty.share
on react
when hook=n_empty move=share fit=good|neutral
- Go on. I could use the news.
- Ha. Now that's the first interesting thing today.
- You see, this is why I like visitors who aren't sick.

@rule move.h.n_empty.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_empty
- Ask if the cotton balls are in order

@rule react.h.n_empty.tease
on react
when hook=n_empty move=tease fit=good|neutral
- They are. Don't touch them.
- Largest to smallest. Don't laugh.
- You're not sick at all, are you? Out.

@rule day.h.n_alone
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_alone
opens comfort,ask,praise
hook n_alone
feel sad
- It's a little lonely down here, away from the faculty room.
- Everyone comes in when they're hurting and leaves when they're not. That's the job.
- Nobody really visits the infirmary just to say hello.

@rule move.h.n_alone.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_alone
- Say you'll stop by to say hello

@rule react.h.n_alone.comfort
on react
when hook=n_alone move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- That would be nice. Healthy, I hope.
- Thank you. I'd like that.
- You don't have to, but... the door's open.

@rule move.h.n_alone.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_alone
- Ask if she eats with the other staff

@rule react.h.n_alone.ask
on react
when hook=n_alone move=ask fit=good|neutral
- Sometimes. Someone usually comes in halfway through.
- When I can. The infirmary can't lock for lunch.
- I eat at my desk, in case.

@rule move.h.n_alone.praise
on move.praise
when hook=n_alone
- Say people are glad she's here

@rule react.h.n_alone.praise
on react
when hook=n_alone move=praise fit=good|neutral
- That's good to hear.
- They only remember when they need me. But thank you.
- You're sweet. Now go, before you're late.

@rule day.h.n_lunch
on day
when job=nurse tcause=n_lunch
opens comfort,ask,tease
hook n_lunch
feel pout
- I missed lunch. Someone sprained an ankle at noon.
- My bento has been waiting since twelve.
- I tell everyone not to skip meals, and here I am.

@rule move.h.n_lunch.comfort
on move.comfort
when hook=n_lunch
- Tell her to eat now

@rule react.h.n_lunch.comfort
on react
when hook=n_lunch move=comfort fit=good|neutral
- In a minute. As soon as this form is done.
- You're right. Don't tell anyone I forgot.
- Thank you. I was about to.

@rule move.h.n_lunch.ask
on move.ask
when hook=n_lunch
- Ask who got hurt

@rule react.h.n_lunch.ask
on react
when hook=n_lunch move=ask fit=good|neutral
- A second-year, in the gym. Nothing serious.
- I can't say. But tell your friends not to run on wet floors.
- Someone who thought the stairs had one more step.

@rule move.h.n_lunch.tease
on move.tease
when hook=n_lunch
- Say a nurse should follow her own advice

@rule react.h.n_lunch.tease
on react
when hook=n_lunch move=tease fit=good|neutral
- Everyone says that.
- Do as I say, not as I do.
- Touche. I'll eat.

# ================= the two girls =================
@rule duo3.talk.nurse.student
on duo3.talk
when myjob=nurse otherrole=student
- You look pale, {other}. Are you eating? >> Y-yes, I had breakfast. >> Tons! I swear! >> I'm fine. >> Is that a professional opinion?
- Is your ankle better, {other}? >> Much better, thank you. >> Good as new! >> It's fine. >> You remembered?
- Don't run on the stairs, {other}. >> I'll be careful. >> I walk! Quickly! >> I wasn't. >> You saw that?

@rule duo3.talk.student.nurse
on duo3.talk
when myrole=student otherjob=nurse
- {other}, do you have anything for a headache? >> Water, and a nap. >> Yes! Tea and sleep! >> Sleep. >> Have you tried not staying up?
- {other}, thanks for last week. >> You're welcome. How is it now? >> Anytime! All better? >> It's my job. >> Then stop falling down.
- {other}, is the infirmary open at lunch? >> It always is. >> Always! Come by! >> Yes. >> Depends who's asking.

@rule duo3.talk.nurse.teacher
on duo3.talk
when myjob=nurse otherrole=teacher
- Your class has a cough going around. >> I noticed. I'll open a window. >> Ah, is that why it's so quiet?! >> I'll tell them. >> Blame the second row.
- Did you eat lunch today? >> A little, between lessons. >> Crackers count! >> Yes. >> Did you?

@rule duo3.talk.teacher.nurse
on duo3.talk
when myrole=teacher otherjob=nurse
- Is one of my students still with you? >> She's resting. Give her ten minutes. >> Sleeping like a log! >> Yes. >> Why, does she have a test?
- You look tired. Busy day? >> A few sprains. Nothing serious. >> Bandages everywhere! >> The usual. >> Your second-years are a menace.

